        "ai_gen_block_9c13453_AX4PF": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_9c13453",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "header-535aea66b69d43545ce27396fa784b72": null,
            "content": "<h2>Discover Premium LED Light Bulbs for Every Space.</h2><p>Transform your spaces with the brilliance of LED lighting from LiquidLEDs, Australia's premier destination for innovative and energy-efficient lighting solutions. Discover a wide range of LED light products designed to enhance your home, office, or commercial environment with style, efficiency, and unmatched performance.</p><p><strong>Innovative LED Lighting Solutions for Every Space</strong></p><p>With advanced LED light technology, liquidLEDs brings brilliance to your home, office, and commercial spaces. We offer efficient, long-lasting, and stylish lighting options from modern, interior light products to versatile LED solutions. Whether buying an LED light for general use or searching for the best LED light bar in Australia, our collection delivers on performance, aesthetics, and energy savings. Our LED light products are crafted to meet diverse needs, ensuring every space is illuminated precisely and elegantly.</p><p><strong>Discover the Best LED Lighting for Your Interior Spaces</strong></p><p>Upgrade your home ambience with LiquidLEDs' high-quality interior LED light solutions. Our LED night light and <a href=\"https://liquid-leds.com/en-au/collections/led-interior-bulbs\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">LED light interior</span></a> products are perfect for bedrooms, hallways, and living areas, offering soft illumination and modern design. Every interior light LED product we offer is built with efficiency and style in mind, making it easier to create a cozy, well-lit environment tailored to your taste. Experience the perfect blend of functionality and beauty with our carefully curated interior LED light offerings.</p><p><strong>Precision Lighting for Beauty, Functionality, and Ambience</strong></p><p>Achieve flawless lighting for any task with LiquidLEDs' purpose-driven designs. Our LED beauty light options offer perfect clarity for grooming, makeup, and skincare, while our LED spot light solutions provide focused illumination for kitchens, bathrooms, and galleries. Whether you're looking to buy an LED spot light for practical use or highlight specific areas, our lighting systems enhance both aesthetics and functionality.</p><p><strong>Why Choose LiquidLEDs for Your Lighting Needs?</strong></p><p>As a trusted Australian brand, LiquidLEDs combines innovation, efficiency, and style in every product. From sleek LED light bulbs to LED light products that fit your vision, we make it easy to buy LED light products online. Our lights are engineered for long life, energy efficiency, and stunning brightness—perfect for homes, businesses, and creative spaces across Australia. Choose LiquidLEDs for the best LED light bar in Australia and experience lighting that transforms your environment while saving energy.</p><p><strong>Create the Perfect Atmosphere</strong></p><p>With LiquidLEDs, crafting the ideal ambience is effortless. Our LED light solutions are designed to adapt to any mood or setting, from warm, inviting glows for cozy evenings to bright, focused beams for productive workspaces. Whether it's an LED night light for a soothing bedroom vibe or an interior LED light for vibrant living spaces, our products help you set the perfect tone. Explore our range to find the light LED solution that elevates your home or office aesthetic.</p>",
            "preview_height": 140,
            "gradient_height": 60,
            "animation_speed": 300,
